<title>USA: Atlantis Plastics to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Atlantis Plastics to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantis Plastics Inc said Tuesday its board approved the repurchase of up to one million share of its class A common stock.</p>
<p>The company has 7.5 million class A and class B common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Atlantis Plastics manufacturers molded plastic products and polyethylene films.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
